<title>USA: Phoenix, Ariz., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Phoenix, Ariz., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The City of Phoenix, Ariz., said Wednesday it recalculated Prudential Securities Inc's winning bid on the City's $32 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The City said the true interest cost was 5.3584 percent, not the 5.3581 percent Prudential originally calculated.</p>
